Why r137 (not latest): r148 removed the classic examples/js/ scripts and the UMD
build moved to ESM-only; ESM imports are blocked over file:// (CORS), so the
README — which opens from disk — needs these classic (global THREE.*) scripts.
Load order: three.min.js, CopyShader, LuminosityHighPassShader, EffectComposer,
RenderPass, MaskPass, ShaderPass, UnrealBloomPass.
